rive/folders/19kA9fkJE9MXqR3ZGRY3aSKY7t9LSbPK_?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ruuya1124/works/69", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/10d28dea/uploads/origins/64c6ef0e-0b08-4c0c-93eb-e467d1b6523b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=447f8295cb5400917c875a8171933f9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/10d28dea/uploads/origins/64c6ef0e-0b08-4c0c-93eb-e467d1b6523b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=447f8295cb5400917c875a8171933f9e, https://si.imgix.net/10d28dea/uploads/origins/64c6ef0e-0b08-4c0c-93eb-e467d1b6523b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5977511e55fa5ab05213abdf715dff9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/10d28dea/uploads/origins/64c6ef0e-0b08-4c0c-93eb-e467d1b6523b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57ecc8b8634a6fcbc686aafff1670cd4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！もしよければ、またあなたに依頼したいです！今回は、不吉な錬金術師である僕のoc、Arriorを描いてほしいんだ！彼は薬にいたずら好きで、残酷な実験を主に自分自身に対して行う。不吉なことや血なまぐさいことを描いてほしいけど、それ以外は全部あなた次第！読んでくれてありがとう！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ruuya1124/works/68", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4fa5bb54/uploads/origins/58c1e7d1-115a-4a68-889d-aa4e1e4a10b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b13a90a8e6992a0455ff84db4f0e5d2f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4fa5bb54/uploads/origins/58c1e7d1-115a-4a68-889d-aa4e1e4a10b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b13a90a8e6992a0455ff84db4f0e5d2f, https://si.imgix.net/4fa5bb54/uploads/origins/58c1e7d1-115a-4a68-889d-aa4e1e4a10b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtsha